(2392857, 331319, 57420, '<td valign="top">This is great - good job on the detail and I love how the background is out of focus but shows the people in the background.  Nice picture!</td>', 'This is great - good job on the detail and I love how the background is out of focus but shows the people in the background.  Nice picture!', '2006-05-08 10:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392859, 330795, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that she''s walking toward the camera. It really looks like something you''d see on a poster.  The title works for me too. I like the whole "package."</td>', 'I like that she''s walking toward the camera. It really looks like something you''d see on a poster.  The title works for me too. I like the whole "package."', '2006-05-08 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392860, 331187, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but not sure I see it as a movie poster.  The red tones are great for the POP factor.  The perspective and leading line really work well. I love the title.  Ok.... 8</td>', 'I really like this, but not sure I see it as a movie poster.  The red tones are great for the POP factor.  The perspective and leading line really work well. I love the title.  Ok.... 8', '2006-05-08 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392861, 331420, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can see a huge dinosaur lurking off in the distance.  Love the title too. Beautiful tones and the prehistoric aspect works perfectly here.</td>', 'I can see a huge dinosaur lurking off in the distance.  Love the title too. Beautiful tones and the prehistoric aspect works perfectly here.', '2006-05-08 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392862, 331409, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I thought of almost the same scenario but couldn''t carry it off.  Great lighting.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice job. I thought of almost the same scenario but couldn''t carry it off.  Great lighting.  Nicely done.', '2006-05-08 10:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392866, 328896, 15711, '<td valign="top">THis really does look like a movie poster. Nice use of the text and the subject to the left.</td>', 'THis really does look like a movie poster. Nice use of the text and the subject to the left.', '2006-05-08 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392867, 329477, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really can see this as a movie poster.  Great use of post editing and the title is definitely believable as a movie''s name.</td>', 'I really can see this as a movie poster.  Great use of post editing and the title is definitely believable as a movie''s name.', '2006-05-08 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392869, 328723, 15711, '<td valign="top">Clever. Love the post editing.  I can actualy see this as a title too, although it would have to be a comedy. ha ha ha</td>', 'Clever. Love the post editing.  I can actualy see this as a title too, although it would have to be a comedy. ha ha ha', '2006-05-08 10:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392870, 331335, 31889, '<td valign="top">Yep...well done.</td>', 'Yep...well done.', '2006-05-08 10:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392871, 330202, 49716, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but I don''t think I''d go to see the movie with this title.  I''m just voting on the images, so won''t change that :-)</td>', 'I like the image, but I don''t think I''d go to see the movie with this title.  I''m just voting on the images, so won''t change that :-)', '2006-05-08 10:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392872, 329477, 31889, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the pp effort but otherwise fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'Not a fan of the pp effort but otherwise fits the challenge very well.', '2006-05-08 10:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392874, 331225, 19670, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Technically well done.</td>', 'Very cool! Technically well done.', '2006-05-08 10:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392875, 331220, 49716, '<td valign="top">A good capture and composition, but far too much image processing for me.</td>', 'A good capture and composition, but far too much image processing for me.', '2006-05-08 10:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392878, 331329, 31889, '<td valign="top">Armed and dangerous.  Nice job.</td>', 'Armed and dangerous.  Nice job.', '2006-05-08 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392889, 330835, 15711, '<td valign="top">Only because I have a lateral sense of humor, do I like this. ROFL  Really funny.</td>', 'Only because I have a lateral sense of humor, do I like this. ROFL  Really funny.', '2006-05-08 10:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392894, 330592, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL. This is funny. I think it would look more like a movie title if the quotes weren''t around "Professor Clonefinger." That''s a nitpick but I''m particularly picky on titles since to me, that is an integral part of the challenge.  Great originality and clever execution. 7</td>', 'ROFL. This is funny. I think it would look more like a movie title if the quotes weren''t around "Professor Clonefinger." That''s a nitpick but I''m particularly picky on titles since to me, that is an integral part of the challenge.  Great originality and clever execution. 7', '2006-05-08 10:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392899, 331439, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the image.  I''m wondering if it being so "soft" hurts it a bit, as that doesn''t look as much like a movie poster as it would if it were more tack sharp. The leading line and all of the various hues from white to black, showcase the landscape well.  Is that a person lying in the road? If so, I think he needs to be larger to really be impactful. But overall, better than most in this challenge, as it suits a movie both visually and in text. 7</td>', 'I like the title and the image.  I''m wondering if it being so "soft" hurts it a bit, as that doesn''t look as much like a movie poster as it would if it were more tack sharp. The leading line and all of the various hues from white to black, showcase the landscape well.  Is that a person lying in the road? If so, I think he needs to be larger to really be impactful. But overall, better than most in this challenge, as it suits a movie both visually and in text. 7', '2006-05-08 10:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392915, 331205, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. The perspective and colors are good. If I weren''t voting on it for a possible movie poster, I might score it higher. I''m a very lateral thinker, but the title just doesn''t sound anything close to a movie name to me. Maybe I''m being too harsh, but I think the image and title have to work together to create that movie thing, for this particular challenge. To me, it''s not all about the photo, but the two working together. It''s a tough one.</td>', 'I really like this image. The perspective and colors are good. If I weren''t voting on it for a possible movie poster, I might score it higher. I''m a very lateral thinker, but the title just doesn''t sound anything close to a movie name to me. Maybe I''m being too harsh, but I think the image and title have to work together to create that movie thing, for this particular challenge. To me, it''s not all about the photo, but the two working together. It''s a tough one.', '2006-05-08 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392917, 329785, 32254, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome eyes. I bet I''m the 14th person to say that already.</td>', 'Wow, awesome eyes. I bet I''m the 14th person to say that already.', '2006-05-08 11:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392918, 331319, 32254, '<td valign="top">haha, I like it, but I bet you are getting hammered for the extra words in the title and the landscape orientation.</td>', 'haha, I like it, but I bet you are getting hammered for the extra words in the title and the landscape orientation.', '2006-05-08 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392920, 329477, 32254, '<td valign="top">Great stuff, well done.</td>', 'Great stuff, well done.', '2006-05-08 11:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
