(2392930, 331194, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is delusive a word??? I need to run to the dictionary. LOL<br/> <br/>Love the image and I "get it." Ok, you''re right. I just learned a new word and I''m a total vocabulary snob. I thought it was delusional and delusive is different! Ok, upping the score now because I''m a dumba**!</td>', 'Is delusive a word??? I need to run to the dictionary. LOL Love the image and I "get it." Ok, you''re right. I just learned a new word and I''m a total vocabulary snob. I thought it was delusional and delusive is different! Ok, upping the score now because I''m a dumba**!', '2006-05-08 11:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392934, 331136, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Maybe a stretch for a movie, but I love the DOF and the adorable lamb. 7</td>', 'Sweet. Maybe a stretch for a movie, but I love the DOF and the adorable lamb. 7', '2006-05-08 11:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392936, 330516, 15711, '<td valign="top">Never a fan of the parrot shots, but I just love this one. The background is what really does it for me.  Great DOF. The sharpness is terrific and the red/green combination really takes it home for me. If you think about it, the title is funny, but I can actually see it as a movie.</td>', 'Never a fan of the parrot shots, but I just love this one. The background is what really does it for me.  Great DOF. The sharpness is terrific and the red/green combination really takes it home for me. If you think about it, the title is funny, but I can actually see it as a movie.', '2006-05-08 11:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392950, 331379, 31889, '<td valign="top">Very nice...well not really but it fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'Very nice...well not really but it fits the challenge very well.', '2006-05-08 11:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392967, 331228, 31889, '<td valign="top">Clever work with the title and the pic fits well.</td>', 'Clever work with the title and the pic fits well.', '2006-05-08 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2392988, 331438, 49652, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It definitely evokes a sense of pathos.  Can''t wait to see the movie.</td>', 'I love this.  It definitely evokes a sense of pathos.  Can''t wait to see the movie.', '2006-05-08 11:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
