(2393058, 331207, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s old and Destroyed ;) alright. Very nice shot. Like the perspective and overall composition. Though it looks like the clouds where burned/dodged somewhat unevenly?<br/>btw, I do like the word play for the title.</td>', 'It''s old and Destroyed ;) alright. Very nice shot. Like the perspective and overall composition. Though it looks like the clouds where burned/dodged somewhat unevenly?btw, I do like the word play for the title.', '2006-05-08 11:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393074, 331040, 56658, '<td valign="top">It lacks some focus. If it were a movie about a punk band no one would go see it based on this poster. for punk the title should maybe have been Damaging power chords and the clouds in the back are anti-punk rock. this title and photo may haveed worked for a documentery about Blue cheer.</td>', 'It lacks some focus. If it were a movie about a punk band no one would go see it based on this poster. for punk the title should maybe have been Damaging power chords and the clouds in the back are anti-punk rock. this title and photo may haveed worked for a documentery about Blue cheer.', '2006-05-08 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393077, 331456, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is not a three word title using DPC. I am also not fond of the over exposed/high contrast look.</td>', 'This is not a three word title using DPC. I am also not fond of the over exposed/high contrast look.', '2006-05-08 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393080, 331319, 43774, '<td valign="top">Way more than a 3 word title!!!</td>', 'Way more than a 3 word title!!!', '2006-05-08 11:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393090, 329839, 56658, '<td valign="top">I think a dead or very sick fish would have gotten the point across more. overall it seems fairly boring. the blurry botttom gives it a very dirty pond feel so good job there.</td>', 'I think a dead or very sick fish would have gotten the point across more. overall it seems fairly boring. the blurry botttom gives it a very dirty pond feel so good job there.', '2006-05-08 11:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393095, 330610, 35804, '<td valign="top">Hey...did ya set this up in your backyard?...joking : }<br/> <br/>AWESOME shot and a super spectacular action happin'' here.</td>', 'Hey...did ya set this up in your backyard?...joking : } AWESOME shot and a super spectacular action happin'' here.', '2006-05-08 11:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393097, 331295, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro capture. The very narrow dof is really working in your favor here. The eyes are tack sharp and the increasing oof toward the tail draws attention right where you want it to be. The colors are just eye-popping. Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful macro capture. The very narrow dof is really working in your favor here. The eyes are tack sharp and the increasing oof toward the tail draws attention right where you want it to be. The colors are just eye-popping. Well done!', '2006-05-08 12:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393107, 330932, 56658, '<td valign="top">It is a nice shot of pelicans but just doesn''t work as a movie title. now it could be a movie title such as  the pelican brief but then this poster wouldn''t work. as far as the photo is concerned i think the focus on the right and left ones could be better. It doesn''t seem to tell a story.</td>', 'It is a nice shot of pelicans but just doesn''t work as a movie title. now it could be a movie title such as  the pelican brief but then this poster wouldn''t work. as far as the photo is concerned i think the focus on the right and left ones could be better. It doesn''t seem to tell a story.', '2006-05-08 12:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393118, 331181, 56658, '<td valign="top">Intersting photo. I can''t tell from the photo and title together what the movie would be about.</td>', 'Intersting photo. I can''t tell from the photo and title together what the movie would be about.', '2006-05-08 12:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393122, 331295, 24681, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. You have a really good blend of some very rich colors in this photograph. Great shot! Good luck in the challenge :-)</td>', 'Simply beautiful. You have a really good blend of some very rich colors in this photograph. Great shot! Good luck in the challenge :-)', '2006-05-08 12:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393123, 330835, 56658, '<td valign="top">WEll he looks demonic and psychotic. I could see this being a Troma moive. great detail on the hairs.  I also like the DOF.</td>', 'WEll he looks demonic and psychotic. I could see this being a Troma moive. great detail on the hairs.  I also like the DOF.', '2006-05-08 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393146, 331380, 56658, '<td valign="top">a very blair witch feel. I like the concept. the title and image work together fairly well. I don''t care for the blue hue, maybe a darker yellow hue would work better. the eye should be bloodshot to show more of a crazy feel. the hair could be crazier and take up some of the space in between the logo and the subject.</td>', 'a very blair witch feel. I like the concept. the title and image work together fairly well. I don''t care for the blue hue, maybe a darker yellow hue would work better. the eye should be bloodshot to show more of a crazy feel. the hair could be crazier and take up some of the space in between the logo and the subject.', '2006-05-08 12:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
