(2393215, 330076, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, definitely something different :) Scroll the photo down a bit so that the horizon of the sea in the background is level with the top of your browser and see that the horizon is pretty slanted. It is not something someone would notice immediately, but my probing eyes spotted it straight away. So as meeeeeen as I am I am gonna deduct a big fat juicy point for it, and if I weren''t in such a good modd I would even deduct two :)</td>', 'Good idea, definitely something different :) Scroll the photo down a bit so that the horizon of the sea in the background is level with the top of your browser and see that the horizon is pretty slanted. It is not something someone would notice immediately, but my probing eyes spotted it straight away. So as meeeeeen as I am I am gonna deduct a big fat juicy point for it, and if I weren''t in such a good modd I would even deduct two :)', '2006-05-08 12:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
