(2393339, 331086, 50695, '<td valign="top">Hmm... no fair using Scarlett Johannsen!! ;) Great model and nice striking composition that a poster needs. I''m a little bit thrown, though, because she doesn''t seem to be dancing but she does seem to be posing. For me to feel like I''m in the movie, even if only for a moment, the shot should feel candid, unless of course she''s performing (or perhaps talking to an interviewer, to relate to the title).</td>', 'Hmm... no fair using Scarlett Johannsen!! ;) Great model and nice striking composition that a poster needs. I''m a little bit thrown, though, because she doesn''t seem to be dancing but she does seem to be posing. For me to feel like I''m in the movie, even if only for a moment, the shot should feel candid, unless of course she''s performing (or perhaps talking to an interviewer, to relate to the title).', '2006-05-08 13:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
