(2393349, 330509, 50695, '<td valign="top">But I don''t know what the dog is using the car for. S/he seems merely to be posing on it. The photo, though a pleasing composition, is static. It doesn''t seem like part of a movie and doesn''t make me want to see what''s going to happen (and what has already happened), the way a poster should.</td>', 'But I don''t know what the dog is using the car for. S/he seems merely to be posing on it. The photo, though a pleasing composition, is static. It doesn''t seem like part of a movie and doesn''t make me want to see what''s going to happen (and what has already happened), the way a poster should.', '2006-05-08 13:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
