(2393367, 331066, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, though I''m not entirely convinced about this movie. A movie about a courtyard? From your shot I''d say the movie is really about the portal. You do a pretty good job of making me wonder what''s in the portal, but then again your composition is so balanced that it adds a certain serenity that undercuts the suspense. Still I might go see the movie just for the cinematography! :)</td>', 'Nice composition, though I''m not entirely convinced about this movie. A movie about a courtyard? From your shot I''d say the movie is really about the portal. You do a pretty good job of making me wonder what''s in the portal, but then again your composition is so balanced that it adds a certain serenity that undercuts the suspense. Still I might go see the movie just for the cinematography! :)', '2006-05-08 13:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2393368, 330461, 55738, '<td valign="top">This is really noisy in the background, the colors are nice, but the noise really detracts from the appeal.</td>', 'This is really noisy in the background, the colors are nice, but the noise really detracts from the appeal.', '2006-05-08 13:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
