(2393389, 330196, 34041, '<td valign="top">Blood on his nose?  Great shot. the eyes look right at you. nice lighting, too. My only suggestions is that it might have been nice to see a bit of his teeth, too.</td>', 'Blood on his nose?  Great shot. the eyes look right at you. nice lighting, too. My only suggestions is that it might have been nice to see a bit of his teeth, too.', '2006-05-08 13:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
