(2394395, 330831, 35044, '<td valign="top">I thnk that this could be scarier with some different lighting - It needs a torchlight facing up from below!  The blacks need to be closer to black, and the pool of light should pick out the subject, rather than giving a full frontal.  Good backlightingm, though!</td>', 'I thnk that this could be scarier with some different lighting - It needs a torchlight facing up from below!  The blacks need to be closer to black, and the pool of light should pick out the subject, rather than giving a full frontal.  Good backlightingm, though!', '2006-05-08 18:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
