(2394463, 331066, 35044, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract quality of this image.  Well composed.  I like the colour desat and palette on the wall.  However, I am having difficulty seeing the film poster qualities - maybe a dragon shadow on the wall is required (though I have no idea how you would get it).</td>', 'I like the abstract quality of this image.  Well composed.  I like the colour desat and palette on the wall.  However, I am having difficulty seeing the film poster qualities - maybe a dragon shadow on the wall is required (though I have no idea how you would get it).', '2006-05-08 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394468, 330598, 35044, '<td valign="top">Super colours.  Great composition.</td>', 'Super colours.  Great composition.', '2006-05-08 18:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394469, 331433, 20075, '<td valign="top">That''s kind of... chilling!  Which is probably the effect you''re going for, so good job. :)  One suggestion, though - it took me quite some time to recognize what the cleaver was.  The blade looks too short from this angle and probably wiht this focal length, too.  I''m going to guess that a telephoto was used for this.  Maybe using a wider angle, and stepping closer, would produce a better look.</td>', 'That''s kind of... chilling!  Which is probably the effect you''re going for, so good job. :)  One suggestion, though - it took me quite some time to recognize what the cleaver was.  The blade looks too short from this angle and probably wiht this focal length, too.  I''m going to guess that a telephoto was used for this.  Maybe using a wider angle, and stepping closer, would produce a better look.', '2006-05-08 18:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
