(2394538, 331084, 35044, '<td valign="top">Loveley long exposure.  Looks as though you shot this on a cloudy day - a bit more light would have upped the contrast a bit.</td>', 'Loveley long exposure.  Looks as though you shot this on a cloudy day - a bit more light would have upped the contrast a bit.', '2006-05-08 18:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394540, 331136, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. great bokeh!</td>', 'Lovely image. great bokeh!', '2006-05-08 19:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394545, 330538, 35044, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Your syringe looks a bit bent out of shape.  The tip of the needle is a focus point, but is fractionally out of focus.  I might have been tempted to focus more on those wonderful bubbles in the syringe.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Your syringe looks a bit bent out of shape.  The tip of the needle is a focus point, but is fractionally out of focus.  I might have been tempted to focus more on those wonderful bubbles in the syringe.', '2006-05-08 19:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394556, 331398, 35044, '<td valign="top">Scary eye!  Very interesting image.  Well composed.  Not the greatest amount of detail in the hair and some over exposure, but well conceived.</td>', 'Scary eye!  Very interesting image.  Well composed.  Not the greatest amount of detail in the hair and some over exposure, but well conceived.', '2006-05-08 19:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394559, 331383, 35044, '<td valign="top">Funny! Very grainy (intentional?) .  Nicely lit - door is done v well.</td>', 'Funny! Very grainy (intentional?) .  Nicely lit - door is done v well.', '2006-05-08 19:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394564, 329844, 35044, '<td valign="top">great capture! lots of detail.</td>', 'great capture! lots of detail.', '2006-05-08 19:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394568, 331164, 35044, '<td valign="top">Indeed!  I might have thought about cropping this to fill the frame with more of the action.  Nice image.</td>', 'Indeed!  I might have thought about cropping this to fill the frame with more of the action.  Nice image.', '2006-05-08 19:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394569, 331108, 42100, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice and the setting very beautiful.  However the transition between shaded areas and areas of full sun, makes the photo very contrasty and keeps the focal point from really popping.</td>', 'The composition is very nice and the setting very beautiful.  However the transition between shaded areas and areas of full sun, makes the photo very contrasty and keeps the focal point from really popping.', '2006-05-08 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394570, 328744, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great perspective - I will now have to go for a walk around the Lloyds building to find it!</td>', 'Great perspective - I will now have to go for a walk around the Lloyds building to find it!', '2006-05-08 19:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394572, 331313, 35044, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how you got this, but it is an interesting colour combo!  lots of grain and not too much detail, and there is a funny cicle around the moon in the blue (lens reflection?).</td>', 'I am not sure how you got this, but it is an interesting colour combo!  lots of grain and not too much detail, and there is a funny cicle around the moon in the blue (lens reflection?).', '2006-05-08 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394573, 331398, 42100, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation really is fitting for the film subject and title.  Some of the furry space to the right is a bit too bright and competes a little too much with the eye.</td>', 'The selective desaturation really is fitting for the film subject and title.  Some of the furry space to the right is a bit too bright and competes a little too much with the eye.', '2006-05-08 19:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394578, 331388, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours.  i might have cropped down the image o focus on the clown fish - the part cropped yellow fish in the background distreacts.</td>', 'Lovely colours.  i might have cropped down the image o focus on the clown fish - the part cropped yellow fish in the background distreacts.', '2006-05-08 19:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394581, 330696, 35044, '<td valign="top">This strkes me as an odd image, but perhaps not one that I like.  i am not keen on the strange desat in the grass leaving the yellows in place, and the sbject matter strikes me as simply odd!</td>', 'This strkes me as an odd image, but perhaps not one that I like.  i am not keen on the strange desat in the grass leaving the yellows in place, and the sbject matter strikes me as simply odd!', '2006-05-08 19:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394584, 331450, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - shame that the sky is so blown ou, when it is such a key part of your image.</td>', 'Nice idea - shame that the sky is so blown ou, when it is such a key part of your image.', '2006-05-08 19:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394585, 329839, 42100, '<td valign="top">The quality of the water is very fitting for your film theme and title.  But with the fish of similar color it leaves your photo looking a little bland.  A tighter crop on one of the fish(or a more bunched up cluster of fish) would put a little more oomf into the photo.</td>', 'The quality of the water is very fitting for your film theme and title.  But with the fish of similar color it leaves your photo looking a little bland.  A tighter crop on one of the fish(or a more bunched up cluster of fish) would put a little more oomf into the photo.', '2006-05-08 19:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394589, 331378, 35044, '<td valign="top">Really striking image.  I am not 100% keen on the desat, but do not mind it too much here.  Might have been nice to have her whole shadow in frame.</td>', 'Really striking image.  I am not 100% keen on the desat, but do not mind it too much here.  Might have been nice to have her whole shadow in frame.', '2006-05-08 19:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394590, 330744, 42100, '<td valign="top">The composition is pretty good on this.  The glasses are a bit rough on this with all those reflections, and they also hide the eyes that could of really added to this photo.</td>', 'The composition is pretty good on this.  The glasses are a bit rough on this with all those reflections, and they also hide the eyes that could of really added to this photo.', '2006-05-08 19:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394596, 331225, 35044, '<td valign="top">Freaky!  Green light (torch light?) is interesting and paranormal. No sure that it goes very well with the browns of your wall and wooden surface.</td>', 'Freaky!  Green light (torch light?) is interesting and paranormal. No sure that it goes very well with the browns of your wall and wooden surface.', '2006-05-08 19:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394600, 330743, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours!  Could do with being fractionally sharper (though not at the edges - detail seems to be soft in the colour gradation in the solid parts of the rock)</td>', 'Lovely colours!  Could do with being fractionally sharper (though not at the edges - detail seems to be soft in the colour gradation in the solid parts of the rock)', '2006-05-08 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394609, 331448, 164, '<td valign="top">great title</td>', 'great title', '2006-05-08 19:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394613, 329486, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter!  Would love to see this with some interesting lighting, such as from below.  Flash creates a distracting shadow.  Focus needs to be fractionally forwards (focus closer to the nose and let the DoF keep the ocus on the eye).</td>', 'Great subject matter!  Would love to see this with some interesting lighting, such as from below.  Flash creates a distracting shadow.  Focus needs to be fractionally forwards (focus closer to the nose and let the DoF keep the ocus on the eye).', '2006-05-08 19:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394615, 331409, 35044, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter, title, lighting and setup.  Nice image.</td>', 'I like the subject matter, title, lighting and setup.  Nice image.', '2006-05-08 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394625, 330394, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Looks a bit disembodied without any context.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Looks a bit disembodied without any context.', '2006-05-08 19:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394628, 331319, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Unmistakeably a poster image (though your title is not quite in keeping with the challenge!).</td>', 'Great image!  Unmistakeably a poster image (though your title is not quite in keeping with the challenge!).', '2006-05-08 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394633, 331382, 35044, '<td valign="top">I am not quite sure how the subject andbackground interrelate.  The lighting is a little bit dullm, and for a still life, could do with being a bitmore dramatic.</td>', 'I am not quite sure how the subject andbackground interrelate.  The lighting is a little bit dullm, and for a still life, could do with being a bitmore dramatic.', '2006-05-08 19:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394639, 329989, 35044, '<td valign="top">dark and brooding.  Great idea.  A bit more contrast might work, but overall v good.</td>', 'dark and brooding.  Great idea.  A bit more contrast might work, but overall v good.', '2006-05-08 19:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394649, 330326, 35044, '<td valign="top">scary!  interesting colour maipulation.  Nice quality photo.</td>', 'scary!  interesting colour maipulation.  Nice quality photo.', '2006-05-08 19:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394665, 330955, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great costume! Some of the whites look marginally blown out, but overall v good.</td>', 'Great costume! Some of the whites look marginally blown out, but overall v good.', '2006-05-08 19:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394669, 329999, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  I like the framing of the log at the bottom of the image. Not sure how this relates too strongly to the film image, but a nice picture.</td>', 'Lovely image.  I like the framing of the log at the bottom of the image. Not sure how this relates too strongly to the film image, but a nice picture.', '2006-05-08 19:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394674, 331158, 35044, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure how film posterish this image is, and it does not have a strong aesthetic quality.  People in the background are distracting.</td>', 'Not quite sure how film posterish this image is, and it does not have a strong aesthetic quality.  People in the background are distracting.', '2006-05-08 19:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394680, 330819, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice studio image.  there is a slight odd shadow cast just below each arm.  I might have asked the model to look at the camera.</td>', 'Nice studio image.  there is a slight odd shadow cast just below each arm.  I might have asked the model to look at the camera.', '2006-05-08 19:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394692, 331380, 17507, '<td valign="top">I find the blue monotone to be a bit too sedate to convey "crazy." Also, the model''s expression is a bit bland. A wider-open eye looking straight at the camera would have communicated better.</td>', 'I find the blue monotone to be a bit too sedate to convey "crazy." Also, the model''s expression is a bit bland. A wider-open eye looking straight at the camera would have communicated better.', '2006-05-08 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394700, 331456, 17507, '<td valign="top">Interesting graphical treatment of the photograph. I think this would make a good movie poster. Not too sure how well the DPC crowd at large will respond to something that isn''t so traditionally photographic - though it''s fine with me.</td>', 'Interesting graphical treatment of the photograph. I think this would make a good movie poster. Not too sure how well the DPC crowd at large will respond to something that isn''t so traditionally photographic - though it''s fine with me.', '2006-05-08 19:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394710, 331205, 17507, '<td valign="top">great perspective and tones. as a candid shot, this is great. it stands on its own merit. however, WRT the challenge itself, i''m not so sure. the thing the guy is drinking looks more like a red bull or some other energy drink than an alcoholic beverage, and i see little else that indicates drunkenness or prayer.</td>', 'great perspective and tones. as a candid shot, this is great. it stands on its own merit. however, WRT the challenge itself, i''m not so sure. the thing the guy is drinking looks more like a red bull or some other energy drink than an alcoholic beverage, and i see little else that indicates drunkenness or prayer.', '2006-05-08 19:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394714, 330466, 17507, '<td valign="top">great setup in this photo. i like the graphical elements and the use of ripped paper. i wish the yellow cast were not so strong.</td>', 'great setup in this photo. i like the graphical elements and the use of ripped paper. i wish the yellow cast were not so strong.', '2006-05-08 19:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394724, 329990, 17507, '<td valign="top">"Prince Charles" seems to be a reference to the British Prince Charles, and if so, the resemblance is not apt. Maybe "Prince Charming" would have worked better?</td>', '"Prince Charles" seems to be a reference to the British Prince Charles, and if so, the resemblance is not apt. Maybe "Prince Charming" would have worked better?', '2006-05-08 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394731, 328888, 17507, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture. the tones and colors are great; wonderful use of leading lines; the composition is spot on. this picture communicates ''perfect'' and ''calm'' very well. I do not, however, see ''death'' in this photo.</td>', 'beautiful picture. the tones and colors are great; wonderful use of leading lines; the composition is spot on. this picture communicates ''perfect'' and ''calm'' very well. I do not, however, see ''death'' in this photo.', '2006-05-08 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394735, 331448, 17507, '<td valign="top">the white dress provides a brilliant focal point in this composition. the movement of your model is dynamic and engaging. lighting, dof, and color are very well done. the title you have chosen fits the image well, and does not itself seem forced. slight nitpick: not sure I could envision a movie actually carrying this title.</td>', 'the white dress provides a brilliant focal point in this composition. the movement of your model is dynamic and engaging. lighting, dof, and color are very well done. the title you have chosen fits the image well, and does not itself seem forced. slight nitpick: not sure I could envision a movie actually carrying this title.', '2006-05-08 20:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2394736, 329850, 17507, '<td valign="top">now if you could tell me how you''d turn Duck Plug Clogged into a feature-length film (or even a five-minute short), I''m sure I''d be fascinated. ahem. this seems like a bit of a shoe-in to me.</td>', 'now if you could tell me how you''d turn Duck Plug Clogged into a feature-length film (or even a five-minute short), I''m sure I''d be fascinated. ahem. this seems like a bit of a shoe-in to me.', '2006-05-08 20:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
