(2396546, 330394, 50695, '<td valign="top">Let''s see, Delta Papa Charlie means... DPC. The title doesn''t get very far. Nice picture, though. By cropping off one of the wings you make a distinctive silhouette for the plane. I can even see it being a logo for the movie. So points for a dynamic simple image, but no extra points for making me interested in the movie.</td>', 'Let''s see, Delta Papa Charlie means... DPC. The title doesn''t get very far. Nice picture, though. By cropping off one of the wings you make a distinctive silhouette for the plane. I can even see it being a logo for the movie. So points for a dynamic simple image, but no extra points for making me interested in the movie.', '2006-05-09 09:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
