(2396580, 330415, 50695, '<td valign="top">Oh no! A multitude of Darths! Good dramatic lighting and DOF. I can''t wait to see the world''s first potatomation feature!</td>', 'Oh no! A multitude of Darths! Good dramatic lighting and DOF. I can''t wait to see the world''s first potatomation feature!', '2006-05-09 10:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396581, 328744, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s some pretty serious angle and perspective.  Lots of great detail to look at also.  Very nice!</td>', 'Wow, that''s some pretty serious angle and perspective.  Lots of great detail to look at also.  Very nice!', '2006-05-09 10:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396582, 329850, 50695, '<td valign="top">The image is very sharp, sexy and poster-like, but your title is no movie. It just describes the picture.</td>', 'The image is very sharp, sexy and poster-like, but your title is no movie. It just describes the picture.', '2006-05-09 10:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396585, 331333, 56658, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. the poker stuff in the corner really works for me.  the light could have been better but I understand how tough it can be. focus seems soft on the poker stuff but over all good idea.</td>', 'I like the idea. the poker stuff in the corner really works for me.  the light could have been better but I understand how tough it can be. focus seems soft on the poker stuff but over all good idea.', '2006-05-09 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396587, 330790, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo, very cool composition.  The fade to black as you move left is a great look.  The white of the eye looks almost a little overprocessed.</td>', 'Great photo, very cool composition.  The fade to black as you move left is a great look.  The white of the eye looks almost a little overprocessed.', '2006-05-09 10:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396589, 331105, 50695, '<td valign="top">I want the bird to be bigger so I can properly see those claws. After all, that''s the only thing "deadly" about the image. I assume that the title is somebody''s name? Is it a person''s name or the bird''s name? I know that some mystery is good for creating an urgency to solve the mystery, but too much mystery and the viewer never gets drawn in.</td>', 'I want the bird to be bigger so I can properly see those claws. After all, that''s the only thing "deadly" about the image. I assume that the title is somebody''s name? Is it a person''s name or the bird''s name? I know that some mystery is good for creating an urgency to solve the mystery, but too much mystery and the viewer never gets drawn in.', '2006-05-09 10:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396591, 329999, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s a deep petrified canyon, and a nice picture of a deep petrified canyon. But where''s the movie?</td>', 'Yes, it''s a deep petrified canyon, and a nice picture of a deep petrified canyon. But where''s the movie?', '2006-05-09 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396593, 328896, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  Good capture of expression and great composition.  The PP is well done and is fitting.</td>', 'Great photo!  Good capture of expression and great composition.  The PP is well done and is fitting.', '2006-05-09 10:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396594, 331398, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like it. Large fields of different tones spiraling around a red center. Plus, you bring the viewer *very* close to the danger. There''s even room on the right for text.</td>', 'I like it. Large fields of different tones spiraling around a red center. Plus, you bring the viewer *very* close to the danger. There''s even room on the right for text.', '2006-05-09 10:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396597, 331066, 56658, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t flow well but pretty original. I like the photo and the desat adds some nice mood. what would have been really cool is if you could have had some red lights inside like eyes. or of course flames coming out but that would be much harder.</td>', 'The title doesn''t flow well but pretty original. I like the photo and the desat adds some nice mood. what would have been really cool is if you could have had some red lights inside like eyes. or of course flames coming out but that would be much harder.', '2006-05-09 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396601, 329434, 38509, '<td valign="top">nice subject, altough i think the colors are washed out a bit</td>', 'nice subject, altough i think the colors are washed out a bit', '2006-05-09 10:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396603, 331382, 38509, '<td valign="top">so so ... nice drink by the way :-)</td>', 'so so ... nice drink by the way :-)', '2006-05-09 10:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396606, 331448, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is one of those feel good French movies that have been coming out in the last decade, probably made specifically for Americans who want the cachet of going to a foreign film without actually having experience anything intellectually different. But I have to admit that the actress looks like a lot of fun. Maybe this is a comedy, or at least will have a sense of humor about itself. She really should put some shoes on, though. Nice composition. Those trees are really soaring (they don''t look like conifers, but I won''t tell if you won''t), and you can put your text up there. Well done.</td>', 'This is one of those feel good French movies that have been coming out in the last decade, probably made specifically for Americans who want the cachet of going to a foreign film without actually having experience anything intellectually different. But I have to admit that the actress looks like a lot of fun. Maybe this is a comedy, or at least will have a sense of humor about itself. She really should put some shoes on, though. Nice composition. Those trees are really soaring (they don''t look like conifers, but I won''t tell if you won''t), and you can put your text up there. Well done.', '2006-05-09 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396610, 330516, 38509, '<td valign="top">cool animal ! nice photo</td>', 'cool animal ! nice photo', '2006-05-09 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396611, 330711, 38509, '<td valign="top">great focus, lovely compo , nice background, low saturated colors ...</td>', 'great focus, lovely compo , nice background, low saturated colors ...', '2006-05-09 10:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396613, 331160, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, probably a little move catwalk than silver screen.  Very good composition and the dramatic lighting is gret.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice photo, probably a little move catwalk than silver screen.  Very good composition and the dramatic lighting is gret.  Well done!', '2006-05-09 10:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396614, 330516, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic image with rich color. I am intrigued to know what this horrible parrot is writing about. What evils have those big red eyes seen? I bet this is a pretentious indie horror movie, but I still want to see it!</td>', 'Nice dramatic image with rich color. I am intrigued to know what this horrible parrot is writing about. What evils have those big red eyes seen? I bet this is a pretentious indie horror movie, but I still want to see it!', '2006-05-09 10:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396615, 331339, 38509, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2006-05-09 10:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396616, 329854, 56658, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! it seems like the model has long hair. the only thing I think could make it more interseting is if the hair was down and matted and sweaty.</td>', 'Fantastic! it seems like the model has long hair. the only thing I think could make it more interseting is if the hair was down and matted and sweaty.', '2006-05-09 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396618, 330418, 38509, '<td valign="top">they are on the LOOOSE ! :-) funny photo, good for a movie ...</td>', 'they are on the LOOOSE ! :-) funny photo, good for a movie ...', '2006-05-09 10:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396620, 331326, 38509, '<td valign="top">scary, nice effect !</td>', 'scary, nice effect !', '2006-05-09 10:22:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2396621, 328792, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you mean psychedelic. Then again, his smile is awfully friendly. Maybe he just drank some Tequila. It''s a good poster-like image, but the smile deflates the drama. He just seems like he''s posing, rather than involved in some dramatic situation.</td>', 'I don''t think you mean psychedelic. Then again, his smile is awfully friendly. Maybe he just drank some Tequila. It''s a good poster-like image, but the smile deflates the drama. He just seems like he''s posing, rather than involved in some dramatic situation.', '2006-05-09 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396622, 330511, 38509, '<td valign="top">great clouds and colors</td>', 'great clouds and colors', '2006-05-09 10:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396623, 331102, 38509, '<td valign="top">oh. what is this ? very interesting shapes</td>', 'oh. what is this ? very interesting shapes', '2006-05-09 10:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396626, 329559, 42100, '<td valign="top">Love the transition of red to purple of the sky.  Very powerful image with the lightning, you can even see the smoldering air from the initial strikes.<br/>Cool photograph!</td>', 'Love the transition of red to purple of the sky.  Very powerful image with the lightning, you can even see the smoldering air from the initial strikes.Cool photograph!', '2006-05-09 10:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396628, 329850, 38509, '<td valign="top">why is the ducky orange ? maybe yellow ... otherwise good idea</td>', 'why is the ducky orange ? maybe yellow ... otherwise good idea', '2006-05-09 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396630, 331445, 38509, '<td valign="top">good subject and idea, nice tones and POV</td>', 'good subject and idea, nice tones and POV', '2006-05-09 10:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396632, 331403, 38509, '<td valign="top">yea. cool title and nice action photo</td>', 'yea. cool title and nice action photo', '2006-05-09 10:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396634, 330066, 38509, '<td valign="top">hmm, i do not recognize that ... but i like the colors</td>', 'hmm, i do not recognize that ... but i like the colors', '2006-05-09 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396635, 331083, 50695, '<td valign="top">A war movie from the point of view of the losing side. Those are the best war stories, imho. I like this poster. You''ve well simulated the photography of that time. The pose conveys death well, including the depersonalization of his head being out of view. Instead of a face, we just have a flag waving futilely in the background. A nice tension between image and title.</td>', 'A war movie from the point of view of the losing side. Those are the best war stories, imho. I like this poster. You''ve well simulated the photography of that time. The pose conveys death well, including the depersonalization of his head being out of view. Instead of a face, we just have a flag waving futilely in the background. A nice tension between image and title.', '2006-05-09 10:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396636, 330955, 56658, '<td valign="top">I could easily see this on a poster although I wouldn''t go near it unless my wife made me:) I think theold outfit and wig is a nice touch. the lighting is uneven with some shadows and some parts blown out. good job.</td>', 'I could easily see this on a poster although I wouldn''t go near it unless my wife made me:) I think theold outfit and wig is a nice touch. the lighting is uneven with some shadows and some parts blown out. good job.', '2006-05-09 10:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
