(2396658, 330726, 50695, '<td valign="top">A great image. The title isn''t great. After all, the image conveys all that and more, but it''s not terrible either. It would be nice if the title suggested a story rather than just the character, but at least it doesn''t detract. This is probably an interesting indie movie about a demon child (not literally).</td>', 'A great image. The title isn''t great. After all, the image conveys all that and more, but it''s not terrible either. It would be nice if the title suggested a story rather than just the character, but at least it doesn''t detract. This is probably an interesting indie movie about a demon child (not literally).', '2006-05-09 10:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396660, 331237, 38509, '<td valign="top">yea, nice work ... good title and poster</td>', 'yea, nice work ... good title and poster', '2006-05-09 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
