(2396664, 331319, 50695, '<td valign="top">uh oh, is that motion blur? I give you the benefit of the doubt, of course. And ashamedly I have to admit that this is probably the first movie I''d go see out of all of them so far.</td>', 'uh oh, is that motion blur? I give you the benefit of the doubt, of course. And ashamedly I have to admit that this is probably the first movie I''d go see out of all of them so far.', '2006-05-09 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396666, 331406, 50695, '<td valign="top">oooo that''s harsh. Well done. Backlighting to good effect. Great pose from both models. Lots of darkness to fit the mood.</td>', 'oooo that''s harsh. Well done. Backlighting to good effect. Great pose from both models. Lots of darkness to fit the mood.', '2006-05-09 10:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396672, 331163, 47534, '<td valign="top">Dazzling, decollete, deflowered (sorry!), delectable, delicious, delightful, desirable...<br/> <br/>An absolutely beautiful woman!!!  She wears her pregnancy in an almost vivacious manner in this picture, and it is stunning!!!!!</td>', 'Dazzling, decollete, deflowered (sorry!), delectable, delicious, delightful, desirable... An absolutely beautiful woman!!!  She wears her pregnancy in an almost vivacious manner in this picture, and it is stunning!!!!!', '2006-05-09 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396676, 330922, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice image but the title just seems to be an explanation, albeit poetical, of the image rather than the title of a movie. In fact, I would love to write a poem usinig this title and image. I suppose I could imagine the title to be some metaphor that gets explained in the movie, but then I''d be doing more work than you, I think.</td>', 'Nice image but the title just seems to be an explanation, albeit poetical, of the image rather than the title of a movie. In fact, I would love to write a poem usinig this title and image. I suppose I could imagine the title to be some metaphor that gets explained in the movie, but then I''d be doing more work than you, I think.', '2006-05-09 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396678, 328879, 38509, '<td valign="top">wow, great strucure and nice photo ... good title</td>', 'wow, great strucure and nice photo ... good title', '2006-05-09 10:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396679, 331205, 56658, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo and the title is pretty close to good. the last word just seems a bit off to me.  the pov is great.  could deffinantly see this on a poster. I think maybe I would crop out the car.</td>', 'I really like the photo and the title is pretty close to good. the last word just seems a bit off to me.  the pov is great.  could deffinantly see this on a poster. I think maybe I would crop out the car.', '2006-05-09 10:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2396680, 330317, 50695, '<td valign="top">Very well done. This is clearly Michael Moore''s next movie. I''m first on line.</td>', 'Very well done. This is clearly Michael Moore''s next movie. I''m first on line.', '2006-05-09 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
