(2397487, 330202, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting title, and the image doesn''t give any insight into it. But it''s a good dramatic image of a cross-dressing killer. Maybe there''s a better word than "cash" that can relate to the woman being disguised. Or maybe a better word than "Precious". Yeah, I think "Precious" is the weak link. But a good image that hints at an interesting story.</td>', 'Not a very interesting title, and the image doesn''t give any insight into it. But it''s a good dramatic image of a cross-dressing killer. Maybe there''s a better word than "cash" that can relate to the woman being disguised. Or maybe a better word than "Precious". Yeah, I think "Precious" is the weak link. But a good image that hints at an interesting story.', '2006-05-09 16:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397492, 331209, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, and your title hints at the depths below this luminescent surface, though your image deserves a more poetic movie title. Still, it works nicely. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful image, and your title hints at the depths below this luminescent surface, though your image deserves a more poetic movie title. Still, it works nicely. Well done.', '2006-05-09 16:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397499, 331142, 50695, '<td valign="top">Too confusing. Are you saying there are no people in this shot? It''s too far away to tell. And how do you delete people halfway? That would be more interesting. It''s awkward to use a transitive verb with no subject (the adverb assures that this is a verb and not an adjective). I would let that slide if it got some help from the image, but it doesn''t.</td>', 'Too confusing. Are you saying there are no people in this shot? It''s too far away to tell. And how do you delete people halfway? That would be more interesting. It''s awkward to use a transitive verb with no subject (the adverb assures that this is a verb and not an adjective). I would let that slide if it got some help from the image, but it doesn''t.', '2006-05-09 16:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397504, 330955, 50695, '<td valign="top">In the spirit of Tom Jones (the movie). Sure, this works. It promises that the movie will be lovely to look at, and might have some good relationship or sex comedy.</td>', 'In the spirit of Tom Jones (the movie). Sure, this works. It promises that the movie will be lovely to look at, and might have some good relationship or sex comedy.', '2006-05-09 16:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397513, 331349, 50695, '<td valign="top">another episode of Nature. Your title gives some focus to the show, though I don''t look forward to an hour of ducks with their ducklings. The image is balanced but at the same time that makes it static, not very compelling. Your poster does the job, but not in a stellar fashion.</td>', 'another episode of Nature. Your title gives some focus to the show, though I don''t look forward to an hour of ducks with their ducklings. The image is balanced but at the same time that makes it static, not very compelling. Your poster does the job, but not in a stellar fashion.', '2006-05-09 16:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397514, 331171, 50695, '<td valign="top">My guess is that this is a nature show spotlighting a specific region. I can look forward to dazzling visuals but little else. Still, I''m sure public television will buy it.</td>', 'My guess is that this is a nature show spotlighting a specific region. I can look forward to dazzling visuals but little else. Still, I''m sure public television will buy it.', '2006-05-09 16:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
