(2397518, 328896, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good. You found a strong statement in those three unfortunate letters, and your image is powerful as well. The filter you applied is typical for movie posters, especially documentaries that want to seem down-to-earth or even gritty.</td>', 'Good. You found a strong statement in those three unfortunate letters, and your image is powerful as well. The filter you applied is typical for movie posters, especially documentaries that want to seem down-to-earth or even gritty.', '2006-05-09 16:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397521, 330158, 50695, '<td valign="top">No fair! You got Mickey Rourke! :) Good picture, good poster, probably better than the movie: the mystery is there... "where is he going?" "whom is he leaving behind?" A bold simple image that instantly conveys the title.</td>', 'No fair! You got Mickey Rourke! :) Good picture, good poster, probably better than the movie: the mystery is there... "where is he going?" "whom is he leaving behind?" A bold simple image that instantly conveys the title.', '2006-05-09 16:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397525, 331420, 50695, '<td valign="top">Just a hint of flesh would have made this more interesting, but at least you have that circle of stones. I worry this is just an archeological documentary since you didn''t have anything more dramatic to photograph. Sure is a pretty shot, though.</td>', 'Just a hint of flesh would have made this more interesting, but at least you have that circle of stones. I worry this is just an archeological documentary since you didn''t have anything more dramatic to photograph. Sure is a pretty shot, though.', '2006-05-09 16:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397526, 330405, 50695, '<td valign="top">A movie about craters? Sounds like you''re just describing your photograph, and not even correctly: the moon is not a planet. Magnificent photo, though. You''ve clearly got expensive equipment.</td>', 'A movie about craters? Sounds like you''re just describing your photograph, and not even correctly: the moon is not a planet. Magnificent photo, though. You''ve clearly got expensive equipment.', '2006-05-09 16:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
