(2397539, 330196, 50695, '<td valign="top">the extreme closeup makes me hopeful that this is not a nature documentary but some strange thriller in which lions are manipulated into killing people by an evil zookeeper. I''m intrigued, particularly by the blood on his nose.</td>', 'the extreme closeup makes me hopeful that this is not a nature documentary but some strange thriller in which lions are manipulated into killing people by an evil zookeeper. I''m intrigued, particularly by the blood on his nose.', '2006-05-09 16:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397544, 331313, 50695, '<td valign="top">that''s the moon! this might be a colorized poster of an Ed Wood-like 50''s B-movie sci-fi flick, though I would expect some of the concubines to be in the picture. Still, overall I buy it.</td>', 'that''s the moon! this might be a colorized poster of an Ed Wood-like 50''s B-movie sci-fi flick, though I would expect some of the concubines to be in the picture. Still, overall I buy it.', '2006-05-09 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397549, 331378, 50695, '<td valign="top">I imagine this is one of those slow-moving "psychological" indie road movies about Carmen as she hitchhikes across the countryside. The strange thing about the picture is that she''s standing in the middle of the road, which is a really bad place to hitchhike. Maybe she''s overly aggressive about it. She does have an aggressive look on her face. Anything to make the movie more interesting! Good job. (p.s. I think you mean "Driving Past Carmen") (p.p.s. clever name)</td>', 'I imagine this is one of those slow-moving "psychological" indie road movies about Carmen as she hitchhikes across the countryside. The strange thing about the picture is that she''s standing in the middle of the road, which is a really bad place to hitchhike. Maybe she''s overly aggressive about it. She does have an aggressive look on her face. Anything to make the movie more interesting! Good job. (p.s. I think you mean "Driving Past Carmen") (p.p.s. clever name)', '2006-05-09 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397553, 331225, 50695, '<td valign="top">You can''t escape by unplugging your phone! Good cheezy horror/sci-fi flick. I''d go see it. Nice poster-like image as well. The strong lines of green frame a spot on the upper right for text.</td>', 'You can''t escape by unplugging your phone! Good cheezy horror/sci-fi flick. I''d go see it. Nice poster-like image as well. The strong lines of green frame a spot on the upper right for text.', '2006-05-09 16:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
