(2397839, 331455, 36988, '<td valign="top">So I think you did a great job here and very imaginative. Lighting is really good... to me however, there should be some sort of mood and feel to a poster advertising a movie and although this is a great photo, it just doesn''t go the next step... perhaps some filter work would be nice... just an opinion... :) 6</td>', 'So I think you did a great job here and very imaginative. Lighting is really good... to me however, there should be some sort of mood and feel to a poster advertising a movie and although this is a great photo, it just doesn''t go the next step... perhaps some filter work would be nice... just an opinion... :) 6', '2006-05-09 17:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2397842, 331207, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I see this certainly good enough for an advertisement of some kind but I don''t link a movie to it unfortunately. It is a very nice shot though... :)6</td>', 'Nice job. I see this certainly good enough for an advertisement of some kind but I don''t link a movie to it unfortunately. It is a very nice shot though... :)6', '2006-05-09 17:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
