(2398195, 331405, 56658, '<td valign="top">did you just tell her to act like courtney love:) I like this one alot. I think it would be better if the DOF was large enough to get the foot in focus to.</td>', 'did you just tell her to act like courtney love:) I like this one alot. I think it would be better if the DOF was large enough to get the foot in focus to.', '2006-05-09 19:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2398202, 330394, 24074, '<td valign="top">it looks to me that the last three letters of the tail number are Foxtrot, Foxtrot, India.</td>', 'it looks to me that the last three letters of the tail number are Foxtrot, Foxtrot, India.', '2006-05-09 19:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2398214, 330599, 3087, '<td valign="top">Moody! Lighting really works to convey a mood to fit the title/ genre. Soft focus feel is not perhaps typical of film posters but that''s not a big deal. What I like is the simplicity - not an attempt to cram too much in but just a simple shot, well posed and lit.</td>', 'Moody! Lighting really works to convey a mood to fit the title/ genre. Soft focus feel is not perhaps typical of film posters but that''s not a big deal. What I like is the simplicity - not an attempt to cram too much in but just a simple shot, well posed and lit.', '2006-05-09 19:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2398243, 331304, 33068, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Love the dark and eerie feel!  I could see this as a poster for movie.  Nice job!</td>', 'Wow.  Love the dark and eerie feel!  I could see this as a poster for movie.  Nice job!', '2006-05-09 20:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
