(2398544, 330468, 6519, '<td valign="top">If only they had red eyes, or looked demonic or possessed in some way - these little guys are just tooooooo cute!<br/>Portrait orientation would have worked better for a poster.</td>', 'If only they had red eyes, or looked demonic or possessed in some way - these little guys are just tooooooo cute!Portrait orientation would have worked better for a poster.', '2006-05-09 22:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
