(2398684, 330259, 6519, '<td valign="top">I just loooooooooove this one! It is quirky and has me wondering what the movie is all about. Great shot, good title, well done!</td>', 'I just loooooooooove this one! It is quirky and has me wondering what the movie is all about. Great shot, good title, well done!', '2006-05-09 23:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
