(2401374, 331339, 50695, '<td valign="top">one of the things I''ve learned from voting this challenge is that balanced compositions don''t make for good movie posters. They tend to create a sense of satisfaction, which is fine for viewing a photo, but not good for making a viewer want to see more. For that reason, and also because the claw would be more threatening if there were some space underneath it, this picture isn''t convincing me that there''s a whole movie worth seeing about a parrot claw, even if it deadly. It''s close, though. The head and claw are great. A different crop might have done it.</td>', 'one of the things I''ve learned from voting this challenge is that balanced compositions don''t make for good movie posters. They tend to create a sense of satisfaction, which is fine for viewing a photo, but not good for making a viewer want to see more. For that reason, and also because the claw would be more threatening if there were some space underneath it, this picture isn''t convincing me that there''s a whole movie worth seeing about a parrot claw, even if it deadly. It''s close, though. The head and claw are great. A different crop might have done it.', '2006-05-10 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
