(2401417, 331211, 50695, '<td valign="top">He looks poor, but not desperate. Still, you''re engaging the reader with a sympathetic character. So it''s not a big draw, but it''s a draw. And he''s framed nicely, too. An overall good composition, with the option of putting text on the right.</td>', 'He looks poor, but not desperate. Still, you''re engaging the reader with a sympathetic character. So it''s not a big draw, but it''s a draw. And he''s framed nicely, too. An overall good composition, with the option of putting text on the right.', '2006-05-10 13:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401420, 330039, 28710, '<td valign="top">This would be much more hilarious fun with some selective desat and some ''replace color''...</td>', 'This would be much more hilarious fun with some selective desat and some ''replace color''...', '2006-05-10 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401425, 331160, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good dramatic lighting and composition. My only wish is a little more emotion from the model. Right now she just looks a little peeved.</td>', 'Good dramatic lighting and composition. My only wish is a little more emotion from the model. Right now she just looks a little peeved.', '2006-05-10 13:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401431, 329511, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a clever title trying to make a nature documentary interesting. Public television will definitely pick this up.</td>', 'Good composition and a clever title trying to make a nature documentary interesting. Public television will definitely pick this up.', '2006-05-10 13:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401434, 331329, 28710, '<td valign="top">Lookin'' good! watch out for those fingerprints on the sword!</td>', 'Lookin'' good! watch out for those fingerprints on the sword!', '2006-05-10 13:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401436, 330066, 50695, '<td valign="top">I assume that''s a pair of panties? Great poster-like composition and colors, and an extremely intriguing premise. Good job.</td>', 'I assume that''s a pair of panties? Great poster-like composition and colors, and an extremely intriguing premise. Good job.', '2006-05-10 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401440, 329559, 50695, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Steven Seagal movie. Pretty good considering there''s no human element. I''ll go see it.</td>', 'Looks like a Steven Seagal movie. Pretty good considering there''s no human element. I''ll go see it.', '2006-05-10 13:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401448, 330744, 50695, '<td valign="top">a black indie comedy about a Dad who thinks it''s hilarious to act out his own son killing him. When he''s found dead in the jacuzzi, is it suicide or patricide? Will that damn auteur director ever tell us? Okay, good poster.</td>', 'a black indie comedy about a Dad who thinks it''s hilarious to act out his own son killing him. When he''s found dead in the jacuzzi, is it suicide or patricide? Will that damn auteur director ever tell us? Okay, good poster.', '2006-05-10 13:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401450, 330466, 28710, '<td valign="top">ROFL!<br/> <br/>HIlARiOUS!</td>', 'ROFL! HIlARiOUS!', '2006-05-10 13:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401455, 330610, 50695, '<td valign="top">How can you go wrong with huge balls of flame, biplanes and turbo-powered semis? See you in the theater.</td>', 'How can you go wrong with huge balls of flame, biplanes and turbo-powered semis? See you in the theater.', '2006-05-10 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401459, 331158, 28710, '<td valign="top">Heh. Of course you are driving people crazy. Taking pictures of them with a little P&amp;S when you''ve got an SLR and L glass!!! <br/> <br/>Oy! Step back! *punch*<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Heh. Of course you are driving people crazy. Taking pictures of them with a little P&S when you''ve got an SLR and L glass!!!  Oy! Step back! *punch* :)', '2006-05-10 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401465, 331179, 50695, '<td valign="top">the image, though pretty, doesn''t evoke much. the only "character" is a statue, and looks like a statue.</td>', 'the image, though pretty, doesn''t evoke much. the only "character" is a statue, and looks like a statue.', '2006-05-10 13:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401470, 329434, 50695, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look peaceful, and why would I want to see a movie about a distant peaceful current? If it''s metaphorical, then the image should hint at whatever it''s a metaphor for.</td>', 'It doesn''t look peaceful, and why would I want to see a movie about a distant peaceful current? If it''s metaphorical, then the image should hint at whatever it''s a metaphor for.', '2006-05-10 13:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401474, 331261, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ok, I think you have officially found the weirdest place on earth... ????</td>', 'Ok, I think you have officially found the weirdest place on earth... ????', '2006-05-10 13:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401477, 329380, 50695, '<td valign="top">Dolly playing cute does not a movie make. Nice portrait, though.</td>', 'Dolly playing cute does not a movie make. Nice portrait, though.', '2006-05-10 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401485, 331187, 50695, '<td valign="top">I realize that''s an indoor chair, but it still looks too much like a tourist, rather than an eccentric detective. Beautiful landscape, though.</td>', 'I realize that''s an indoor chair, but it still looks too much like a tourist, rather than an eccentric detective. Beautiful landscape, though.', '2006-05-10 13:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401494, 330790, 50695, '<td valign="top">You win. I have to buy tickets now just to see what she does with that carrot. Good job. Good composition (I''ve been finding that "unbalanced" compositions work best for movie posters), good color and light, good expression from the model.</td>', 'You win. I have to buy tickets now just to see what she does with that carrot. Good job. Good composition (I''ve been finding that "unbalanced" compositions work best for movie posters), good color and light, good expression from the model.', '2006-05-10 13:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401501, 330353, 50695, '<td valign="top">red and black works well. Nice bold composition. Good job.</td>', 'red and black works well. Nice bold composition. Good job.', '2006-05-10 13:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401504, 329690, 50695, '<td valign="top">Your title does a better job than most of shoehorning a landscape picture into the competition, so I''ll give you some credit for that, though I think you mean "photogenic."</td>', 'Your title does a better job than most of shoehorning a landscape picture into the competition, so I''ll give you some credit for that, though I think you mean "photogenic."', '2006-05-10 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401509, 331223, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''re illustrating your title but you didn''t make the further step of actually imagining a movie based on your title and then making a poster for that movie. Funny, though.</td>', 'You''re illustrating your title but you didn''t make the further step of actually imagining a movie based on your title and then making a poster for that movie. Funny, though.', '2006-05-10 14:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401521, 331040, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, this fulfills the challenge. The title gives some reason for why we want to see your particular documentary, and your image underlines your emotional point... that the music is divine. I don''t think it''s going to make the theaters, but public television will buy it.</td>', 'Yes, this fulfills the challenge. The title gives some reason for why we want to see your particular documentary, and your image underlines your emotional point... that the music is divine. I don''t think it''s going to make the theaters, but public television will buy it.', '2006-05-10 14:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401525, 329192, 50695, '<td valign="top">The fact that it''s "daily" means it''s "everyday" which doesn''t sound interesting, and when the topic is poultry, you need it to be as intereting as possible. The image, though its composition is nice, doesn''t tell me why I should be interested in poultry either.</td>', 'The fact that it''s "daily" means it''s "everyday" which doesn''t sound interesting, and when the topic is poultry, you need it to be as intereting as possible. The image, though its composition is nice, doesn''t tell me why I should be interested in poultry either.', '2006-05-10 14:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401531, 330418, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a seventies comedy about the sixties. Looks like fun! Good job.</td>', 'This is a seventies comedy about the sixties. Looks like fun! Good job.', '2006-05-10 14:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401542, 330215, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the big curve in your composition. The title doesn''t quite make sense. Do you mean "Dolls Pretending to be Clowns"? Doesn''t sound like a very interesting premise to hang a movie on.</td>', 'I like the big curve in your composition. The title doesn''t quite make sense. Do you mean "Dolls Pretending to be Clowns"? Doesn''t sound like a very interesting premise to hang a movie on.', '2006-05-10 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401549, 330400, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great image, funny title, though I''m left wondering if this is really enough to base a movie on. I suppose it''s one of those nature docs. The title, though funny for this image, is boring as a movie title.</td>', 'Great image, funny title, though I''m left wondering if this is really enough to base a movie on. I suppose it''s one of those nature docs. The title, though funny for this image, is boring as a movie title.', '2006-05-10 14:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401554, 329699, 50695, '<td valign="top">maybe it should be Criminal? Regardless, great image, wonderful use of light, dramatic composition with lots of room for text up top.</td>', 'maybe it should be Criminal? Regardless, great image, wonderful use of light, dramatic composition with lots of room for text up top.', '2006-05-10 14:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401559, 331037, 50695, '<td valign="top">Mostly this looks like you''re describing a picture instead of titling a movie. "Delightful" doesn''t sound eccentric enough to make the movie interesting, and "playing" is not terribly interesting.</td>', 'Mostly this looks like you''re describing a picture instead of titling a movie. "Delightful" doesn''t sound eccentric enough to make the movie interesting, and "playing" is not terribly interesting.', '2006-05-10 14:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401564, 330498, 50695, '<td valign="top">Are you on a movie set? That doesn''t seem fair, but you certainly took good advantage of it. High points from me.</td>', 'Are you on a movie set? That doesn''t seem fair, but you certainly took good advantage of it. High points from me.', '2006-05-10 14:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401573, 331205, 50695, '<td valign="top">The title is awkward but the photo is smooth as silk. I want to see the movie about these people. It reminds me of Lords of Flatbush. Great angle, great subjects.</td>', 'The title is awkward but the photo is smooth as silk. I want to see the movie about these people. It reminds me of Lords of Flatbush. Great angle, great subjects.', '2006-05-10 14:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401581, 331194, 50695, '<td valign="top">Your landscape has a mood that matches your title. Unfortunately your title is awkward. Perhaps you mean "Delusionary", and is the movie really about his cottage and not him? Really cool image, though.</td>', 'Your landscape has a mood that matches your title. Unfortunately your title is awkward. Perhaps you mean "Delusionary", and is the movie really about his cottage and not him? Really cool image, though.', '2006-05-10 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401583, 331315, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great photo, and the title is a funny description, but I get no sense of a movie from this.</td>', 'Great photo, and the title is a funny description, but I get no sense of a movie from this.', '2006-05-10 14:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401592, 331181, 50695, '<td valign="top">that''s closer to roadkill than I want to get. Is this a snuff movie? The title is nicely done. The image is gross.</td>', 'that''s closer to roadkill than I want to get. Is this a snuff movie? The title is nicely done. The image is gross.', '2006-05-10 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401596, 331333, 50695, '<td valign="top">Spelling out the word "Devil" isn''t very interesting. Nice use of darkness, though.</td>', 'Spelling out the word "Devil" isn''t very interesting. Nice use of darkness, though.', '2006-05-10 14:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401601, 329854, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yikes, this is a dramatic, scary image and an intriguing title. I''ll go see it.</td>', 'Yikes, this is a dramatic, scary image and an intriguing title. I''ll go see it.', '2006-05-10 14:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401606, 329048, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice image! The title describes the movie, it''s not the title of the movie. But I won''t detract too much for that.</td>', 'Nice image! The title describes the movie, it''s not the title of the movie. But I won''t detract too much for that.', '2006-05-10 14:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401611, 330412, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dragons just look like toys, which starts to make everything else look like toys, and then the effect is ruined. Nice lighting though on the non-dragon items.</td>', 'the dragons just look like toys, which starts to make everything else look like toys, and then the effect is ruined. Nice lighting though on the non-dragon items.', '2006-05-10 14:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401618, 331433, 50695, '<td valign="top">The cat is reaching for the knife? The claw stuck on the shirt, while visually fascinating, is confusing. The lighting seems flat. The composition is good, though.</td>', 'The cat is reaching for the knife? The claw stuck on the shirt, while visually fascinating, is confusing. The lighting seems flat. The composition is good, though.', '2006-05-10 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401624, 329010, 50695, '<td valign="top">fun and funny. Great expressions from your models!</td>', 'fun and funny. Great expressions from your models!', '2006-05-10 14:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401629, 331173, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice image, visually interesting and conveys the title very well, but what a boring title for your documentary!</td>', 'Nice image, visually interesting and conveys the title very well, but what a boring title for your documentary!', '2006-05-10 14:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401632, 331136, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wonderful black and white, love the curly textures and cute fuzzy face. I have a child, I''ll go for it.</td>', 'Wonderful black and white, love the curly textures and cute fuzzy face. I have a child, I''ll go for it.', '2006-05-10 14:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401637, 330326, 50695, '<td valign="top">the kid seems too tentative. maybe you should have had him kill a few more things before taking the shot. Good dramatic angle though, and good composition.</td>', 'the kid seems too tentative. maybe you should have had him kill a few more things before taking the shot. Good dramatic angle though, and good composition.', '2006-05-10 14:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401640, 331424, 50695, '<td valign="top">Bergman''s most accessible film, though we never do find out how the piano plays by itself. This really feels like a foreign film from the 70s. Great expressive posture from your model and I like the subtle but dramatic shadows. Good composition, too. Notice how pointedly she is looking at empty space. A great way to convey loneliness, despair, etc.</td>', 'Bergman''s most accessible film, though we never do find out how the piano plays by itself. This really feels like a foreign film from the 70s. Great expressive posture from your model and I like the subtle but dramatic shadows. Good composition, too. Notice how pointedly she is looking at empty space. A great way to convey loneliness, despair, etc.', '2006-05-10 14:30:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2401645, 330599, 40370, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is beautiful but beautiful doesn''t exactly represent a dangereous psycho cop. But I still like all the other qualities you''ve captured here ... cool shirt color, composition including the gun, and most of all ... the Stare.</td>', 'The soft focus is beautiful but beautiful doesn''t exactly represent a dangereous psycho cop. But I still like all the other qualities you''ve captured here ... cool shirt color, composition including the gun, and most of all ... the Stare.', '2006-05-10 14:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401647, 329785, 50695, '<td valign="top">A beautiful lawn beast is terrorizing suburbia! sharp, eyecandy image with intriguing strangeness, resonating with the additional excitement of "captivity" brought in with the title. Text fits nicely on the right.</td>', 'A beautiful lawn beast is terrorizing suburbia! sharp, eyecandy image with intriguing strangeness, resonating with the additional excitement of "captivity" brought in with the title. Text fits nicely on the right.', '2006-05-10 14:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401650, 331185, 50695, '<td valign="top">There should be some clue what the movie is about. The image adds no information to the cagey title.</td>', 'There should be some clue what the movie is about. The image adds no information to the cagey title.', '2006-05-10 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401656, 330215, 40370, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the lighting and the focus is excellent, but sort of a weird title.</td>', 'I kind of like the lighting and the focus is excellent, but sort of a weird title.', '2006-05-10 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401658, 330005, 50695, '<td valign="top">The image should have some twist, even a subtle one. Is there one that I''m missing? It has nice contrast though and good composition with room for text on top.</td>', 'The image should have some twist, even a subtle one. Is there one that I''m missing? It has nice contrast though and good composition with room for text on top.', '2006-05-10 14:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401667, 330530, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like the idea, love the dark striped clothing (next time leave out the contrasting hair accessories because it distracts from her fun facial expression), I''d love to see her pigtails. Good job creating the pixie, she has a 3-D quality.</td>', 'Wow, I really like the idea, love the dark striped clothing (next time leave out the contrasting hair accessories because it distracts from her fun facial expression), I''d love to see her pigtails. Good job creating the pixie, she has a 3-D quality.', '2006-05-10 14:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401670, 331405, 40370, '<td valign="top">She gonna boil some rabbits too. Nice POV.</td>', 'She gonna boil some rabbits too. Nice POV.', '2006-05-10 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401681, 331439, 40370, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Love the title. Would be interesting to see a human element in the image, maybe a long shadow or dark silhouette (something left behind), demonstrating the threat of the curse.</td>', 'Very pretty. Love the title. Would be interesting to see a human element in the image, maybe a long shadow or dark silhouette (something left behind), demonstrating the threat of the curse.', '2006-05-10 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401688, 331142, 40370, '<td valign="top">Great reflection. A movie without actors ... cool.</td>', 'Great reflection. A movie without actors ... cool.', '2006-05-10 14:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401693, 329699, 40370, '<td valign="top">A view to a kill perhaps. Wonderful image. Title is a great match.</td>', 'A view to a kill perhaps. Wonderful image. Title is a great match.', '2006-05-10 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401705, 331160, 40370, '<td valign="top">Fashion runway quality. I like the shadows on her arms and dress but wish the eyes were lit up a bit more. Nice work.</td>', 'Fashion runway quality. I like the shadows on her arms and dress but wish the eyes were lit up a bit more. Nice work.', '2006-05-10 14:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401711, 330466, 40370, '<td valign="top">Holy creativity. Robert Langdon looks much different than I imagined.</td>', 'Holy creativity. Robert Langdon looks much different than I imagined.', '2006-05-10 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401726, 330838, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, interesting DOF, love the intense stare to match the title.</td>', 'Nice portrait, interesting DOF, love the intense stare to match the title.', '2006-05-10 14:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401735, 330466, 54826, '<td valign="top">LOL!!</td>', 'LOL!!', '2006-05-10 14:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401755, 331438, 40370, '<td valign="top">The golden and green eye color is spectacular, amazing expression pleading to the camera. Not sure why she is painted so dark though.</td>', 'The golden and green eye color is spectacular, amazing expression pleading to the camera. Not sure why she is painted so dark though.', '2006-05-10 14:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401769, 331384, 40370, '<td valign="top">Creative title, would like to see several runners though, to match the plural in "chasers".</td>', 'Creative title, would like to see several runners though, to match the plural in "chasers".', '2006-05-10 15:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2401778, 330468, 40370, '<td valign="top">Funny. Too bad the farthest left one is blocking the face of the leader of the clones.</td>', 'Funny. Too bad the farthest left one is blocking the face of the leader of the clones.', '2006-05-10 15:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
