(2415124, 331184, 36988, '<td valign="top">Really love the feel of this image. Reminds me a bit of the siren scene in ''Oh Brother...''. Might have worked on hilighting her hair a bit more just to add a bit more of a surrealistic feel but in the end, it''s just really good... :)</td>', 'Really love the feel of this image. Reminds me a bit of the siren scene in ''Oh Brother...''. Might have worked on hilighting her hair a bit more just to add a bit more of a surrealistic feel but in the end, it''s just really good... :)', '2006-05-14 20:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415125, 331329, 36988, '<td valign="top">Great job. One of a handful of entries that has a true feel of a movie poster. Think it''s great... well done!</td>', 'Great job. One of a handful of entries that has a true feel of a movie poster. Think it''s great... well done!', '2006-05-14 20:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415126, 331357, 36988, '<td valign="top">One of a very few that I can envision as a true poster. Great job and very nice editing.</td>', 'One of a very few that I can envision as a true poster. Great job and very nice editing.', '2006-05-14 20:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415129, 330198, 36988, '<td valign="top">I think this image is really cool and certainly would work. The only drawback for me is the grey background which looks a bit dull when compared to the great highlights in the models... Nice job</td>', 'I think this image is really cool and certainly would work. The only drawback for me is the grey background which looks a bit dull when compared to the great highlights in the models... Nice job', '2006-05-14 20:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415130, 329854, 36988, '<td valign="top">One of a very few which I consider to have the true look and feel of a movie poster. The only critisism here is the crop. Would have like to see it longer to reflect the dimensions of a true poster... Well done... :)</td>', 'One of a very few which I consider to have the true look and feel of a movie poster. The only critisism here is the crop. Would have like to see it longer to reflect the dimensions of a true poster... Well done... :)', '2006-05-14 20:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415132, 331418, 36988, '<td valign="top">Really well done and certainly in line with the spirit of the challenge. To me cross between ''Honey I shrunk the Kids'' and ''Meet Joe Black''. you DOF is excellent. Great job</td>', 'Really well done and certainly in line with the spirit of the challenge. To me cross between ''Honey I shrunk the Kids'' and ''Meet Joe Black''. you DOF is excellent. Great job', '2006-05-14 20:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415133, 329699, 36988, '<td valign="top">I really like this and think it suits the spirit of the challenge well. I can''t help thinking that going darker still with the background would help enhance the mood even more, but that''s just me... Great job.</td>', 'I really like this and think it suits the spirit of the challenge well. I can''t help thinking that going darker still with the background would help enhance the mood even more, but that''s just me... Great job.', '2006-05-14 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415135, 331237, 36988, '<td valign="top">So I''m guessing you''re targeting the Adult Movie enthusiast... well it works for me. Think this image captures the spirit of the challenge very well. The movement may be a bit distracting but the imaginative way you''ve captured the mouth and Strawberry makes up for it very well.<br/>Good job... :)</td>', 'So I''m guessing you''re targeting the Adult Movie enthusiast... well it works for me. Think this image captures the spirit of the challenge very well. The movement may be a bit distracting but the imaginative way you''ve captured the mouth and Strawberry makes up for it very well.Good job... :)', '2006-05-14 20:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415136, 330795, 36988, '<td valign="top">One of a very limited number which captures the true spirit of the challenge... This would work very well and the image is excellent... nice job.</td>', 'One of a very limited number which captures the true spirit of the challenge... This would work very well and the image is excellent... nice job.', '2006-05-14 20:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415138, 331438, 36988, '<td valign="top">I really like this alot and think you captured the spirit of the challenge very well... The eyes are so much the focus that I wonder if you couldn''t have gone even darker with the rest of the face to creat an even eerier feel. Perhaps just my take. Nonetheless. A very good image and worthy of a high placement.</td>', 'I really like this alot and think you captured the spirit of the challenge very well... The eyes are so much the focus that I wonder if you couldn''t have gone even darker with the rest of the face to creat an even eerier feel. Perhaps just my take. Nonetheless. A very good image and worthy of a high placement.', '2006-05-14 20:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415139, 330599, 36988, '<td valign="top">So you did an amazing job here. Stylish, nicely edited and with a true feel of an authentic movie poster. If I had to be picky... might have brought out the eye a little more... but who cares... great job... :)</td>', 'So you did an amazing job here. Stylish, nicely edited and with a true feel of an authentic movie poster. If I had to be picky... might have brought out the eye a little more... but who cares... great job... :)', '2006-05-14 20:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415141, 330530, 36988, '<td valign="top">I see this as a very well done ad for a kid comedy... along the lines of ''Honey I shrunk the Kids''. Great lighting and focus, and the dimensions are true for a poster... :)</td>', 'I see this as a very well done ad for a kid comedy... along the lines of ''Honey I shrunk the Kids''. Great lighting and focus, and the dimensions are true for a poster... :)', '2006-05-14 20:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
