(2415680, 330921, 20075, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to see how the title fit, but now that I see it, very creative.  Nice shot - good contrast and DOF.  Could perhaps be composed a bit better.  Perhaps a tight crop on the horse and jockey?</td>', 'Took me a moment to see how the title fit, but now that I see it, very creative.  Nice shot - good contrast and DOF.  Could perhaps be composed a bit better.  Perhaps a tight crop on the horse and jockey?', '2006-05-15 00:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415706, 331387, 7485, '<td valign="top">One of the best uses of lens flare I''ve seen in a long time. And normally I don''t like frames, but your letterbox frame is obviously thematic and also works very well with the panoramic crop. 9</td>', 'One of the best uses of lens flare I''ve seen in a long time. And normally I don''t like frames, but your letterbox frame is obviously thematic and also works very well with the panoramic crop. 9', '2006-05-15 00:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415710, 330955, 20075, '<td valign="top">Oh, how beautiful!  And very creative with your title.  I think the photo could be even better if the yellow was not quite so bright.  Also, a shallower DOF and/or blurring around the edges or woman in the photo may give the shot a pleasant, soft look that might work nicely for this.  Finally, this looks like it may have been taken mid-day by the lighting.  Perhaps a late afternoon shot would look better (it would probably cut down on the brightness of the flowers, for one).  But overall, very nicely done!</td>', 'Oh, how beautiful!  And very creative with your title.  I think the photo could be even better if the yellow was not quite so bright.  Also, a shallower DOF and/or blurring around the edges or woman in the photo may give the shot a pleasant, soft look that might work nicely for this.  Finally, this looks like it may have been taken mid-day by the lighting.  Perhaps a late afternoon shot would look better (it would probably cut down on the brightness of the flowers, for one).  But overall, very nicely done!', '2006-05-15 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415711, 328636, 30861, '<td valign="top">All I have to say to THIS is the profile is ALL wrong for me, LOL. I ain''t got nothing like that nose... I sure as heck hope this was accomplished legally so we can see how it goes :-)</td>', 'All I have to say to THIS is the profile is ALL wrong for me, LOL. I ain''t got nothing like that nose... I sure as heck hope this was accomplished legally so we can see how it goes :-)', '2006-05-15 00:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415717, 331387, 20075, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lense flare.  It works quite well here.</td>', 'Nice use of lense flare.  It works quite well here.', '2006-05-15 00:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2415723, 330345, 75713, '<td valign="top">You have taken a very powerful photo... I have photos of seagulls with their legs dying as the fishing line cuts off circulation... photos of fishing hooks and lures in the breast of a seagull...... thank you</td>', 'You have taken a very powerful photo... I have photos of seagulls with their legs dying as the fishing line cuts off circulation... photos of fishing hooks and lures in the breast of a seagull...... thank you', '2006-05-15 00:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
