(2415761, 330698, 1054, '<td valign="top">I can totally see this as a movie. It''d be nice to be able to see something on  the phone screen, though.</td>', 'I can totally see this as a movie. It''d be nice to be able to see something on  the phone screen, though.', '2006-05-15 00:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
