(2415950, 330744, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post--<br/>I don''t get it.  This is definitely not a sub-5 photograph.  Great lighting, nice composition and excellent focus.  The title works nicely with the capture, as well.  My only critique would be to shift over to the viewer''s left more.  The door jamb is a little distracting.  Nice work despite the score.</td>', '--Trading Post--I don''t get it.  This is definitely not a sub-5 photograph.  Great lighting, nice composition and excellent focus.  The title works nicely with the capture, as well.  My only critique would be to shift over to the viewer''s left more.  The door jamb is a little distracting.  Nice work despite the score.', '2006-05-15 01:42:31.000000', NULL, 0),
