(2416120, 330066, 30364, '<td valign="top">Quote:<br/><i>I see a puppy, a hand, a fish climbing up the puppy''s head; another fish moving up towards the puppy''s right eye and one big fish with it''s mouth wide open on the right :) <br/> <br/>I couldn''t think of a good title.</i> <br/> <br/>Check, check, check, check and check.  I looked for more (there''s sure to be lots more there), but these damned fish kept getting in the way and spoiling my view of all the other hidden stuff.  Interesting objet trouvé.<br/> <br/>As for the title:  Discarded Piscatorial Cardigan.  <br/>Obvious, really ... I can''t believe you missed it!</td>', 'Quote:I see a puppy, a hand, a fish climbing up the puppy''s head; another fish moving up towards the puppy''s right eye and one big fish with it''s mouth wide open on the right :)  I couldn''t think of a good title.  Check, check, check, check and check.  I looked for more (there''s sure to be lots more there), but these damned fish kept getting in the way and spoiling my view of all the other hidden stuff.  Interesting objet trouvé. As for the title:  Discarded Piscatorial Cardigan.  Obvious, really ... I can''t believe you missed it!', '2006-05-15 02:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
