(2416981, 330163, 53164, '<td valign="top">huh? is in reference to the title, not the photograph. the title lacks any sentence structure (even for a title). i thought maybe there was something to it that the author might be able to elaborate upon.  i see that is not the case.<br/> <br/>even now as i type i cannot understand what dark past close means. i gave it a 2 because the title is simply 3 words only one of which describes the existing photograph. the other 2 words do not seem to connect in any way to the photograph. none of the 3 words seem to connect in any format, not even in broken english (or another language for that matter).<br/> <br/>sorry you felt disrespected, that was not the intention. i was merely perplexed so i replied with. huh?<br/> <br/>i now revamp my huh? to what does this mean? and i still score it a 2</td>', 'huh? is in reference to the title, not the photograph. the title lacks any sentence structure (even for a title). i thought maybe there was something to it that the author might be able to elaborate upon.  i see that is not the case. even now as i type i cannot understand what dark past close means. i gave it a 2 because the title is simply 3 words only one of which describes the existing photograph. the other 2 words do not seem to connect in any way to the photograph. none of the 3 words seem to connect in any format, not even in broken english (or another language for that matter). sorry you felt disrespected, that was not the intention. i was merely perplexed so i replied with. huh? i now revamp my huh? to what does this mean? and i still score it a 2', '2006-05-15 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
