(2417102, 329559, 22543, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tapeworm_jimmy:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing shot. I love the exposure. You also picked a great foreground. Could you please post a link to bear_musics landscape thread that you mentioned? Thanks :) Congrats on your well deserved ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=371593&amp;highlight=bearmusic" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music Landscape learning thread</a> <br/> <br/>here you go<br/>GREAT capture... doesn''t appear that you have to worry about what everyone else thinks - we all agree with you! Congrats<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-15 10:18:28.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by tapeworm_jimmy: Amazing shot. I love the exposure. You also picked a great foreground. Could you please post a link to bear_musics landscape thread that you mentioned? Thanks :) Congrats on your well deserved ribbon!   Bear_Music Landscape learning thread  here you goGREAT capture... doesn''t appear that you have to worry about what everyone else thinks - we all agree with you! Congrats', '2006-05-15 11:17:29.000000', '2006-05-15 11:18:28.000000', 0),
