(2417261, 331418, 28710, '<td valign="top">Came back to this as one of my faves in the challenge.<br/> <br/>Incidentally, I think the ''technical flaws'' such as lighting and focus are perfectly complemented by the suit...<br/> <br/>It reminds me very much of Tom Cruise''s suit in Collateral which the director commented in the DVD voice-over was intended to look like a good suit, tailor, but probably tailored in MongKok, HongKong rather than in Milan or something...<br/> <br/>This suit is not of that level of quality, but it has a similar appropriateness for the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Came back to this as one of my faves in the challenge. Incidentally, I think the ''technical flaws'' such as lighting and focus are perfectly complemented by the suit... It reminds me very much of Tom Cruise''s suit in Collateral which the director commented in the DVD voice-over was intended to look like a good suit, tailor, but probably tailored in MongKok, HongKong rather than in Milan or something... This suit is not of that level of quality, but it has a similar appropriateness for the rest of the shot.', '2006-05-15 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
