(2417768, 330594, 53147, '<td valign="top">Trading Post - <br/> <br/>A shame that the focus isnt sharper on this one. The angle/lean is good and the colors are nice. Cloning out the cyclist in the very back would have given you a clean sharp line with the other 3 cyclists. But the big issue is focus. Keep working with your lens and I know you will be doing better soon.</td>', 'Trading Post -  A shame that the focus isnt sharper on this one. The angle/lean is good and the colors are nice. Cloning out the cyclist in the very back would have given you a clean sharp line with the other 3 cyclists. But the big issue is focus. Keep working with your lens and I know you will be doing better soon.', '2006-05-15 14:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
