(2429544, 331207, 7969, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club, what I think works here very well is the tones, color mood of the photo, it is sort of dark and moody a little bit on the wild side.  The sky helps to add a little bit to the drama of the shot.<br/>I really like the textures of the front bumper and of the grass in the foreground.  The compostion of the truck workds very well I like its angle and placement in the photo. <br/>The thing that I do not like is the specific pose of the person, in my opinion had they been turned slightly toward the camera with a little more of their arm outlined it would of made the image even stronger.<br/> <br/>Overall a very good shot, so I am sorry cannot be more critical.  Congrats on your very good finish!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club, what I think works here very well is the tones, color mood of the photo, it is sort of dark and moody a little bit on the wild side.  The sky helps to add a little bit to the drama of the shot.I really like the textures of the front bumper and of the grass in the foreground.  The compostion of the truck workds very well I like its angle and placement in the photo. The thing that I do not like is the specific pose of the person, in my opinion had they been turned slightly toward the camera with a little more of their arm outlined it would of made the image even stronger. Overall a very good shot, so I am sorry cannot be more critical.  Congrats on your very good finish!', '2006-05-18 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
